<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Vons cut to neutral from buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Vons cut to neutral from buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Gary Gilben said he cut the rating on Vons to neutral from buy based on the valuation of Safeway's merger offer calculated from Safeway's closing price on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Based on that price, the implied value of Safeway's offer is $57.45 a share for each Von share, which closed at 55-3/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares were trading at 55-1/2, up 1/8, in midday exchange trading.</p>
</text>
